@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam stateBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam stateStartColor #60C7E5
skinparam stateEndColor #60C7E5
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 48
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

title AFTER MVP — SM-M09 — Provider acceptance and unknown mail outcome
state "Prepared message intent" as Prepared
state "Submitted; awaiting outcome" as InFlight
state "Provider acceptance\nconfirmed" as Accepted
state "Provider rejection\nconfirmed" as Rejected
state "Provider outcome unknown" as Unknown
state "Denied before submission" as Denied
[*] --> Prepared : scoped initial context
Prepared --> Prepared : SM-T051 reviewed content changes\n[new content needs review]
Prepared --> Denied : SM-T052 send request denied\n[authority / context denied]
Prepared --> InFlight : SM-T053 deliberate send / reply\n[review current / authorized]
InFlight --> Accepted : SM-T054 acceptance confirmed\n[provider confirmation]
InFlight --> Rejected : SM-T055 rejection confirmed\n[definite rejection]
InFlight --> Unknown : SM-T056 response ambiguous\n[ambiguous evidence]
Unknown --> Accepted : SM-T057 provider reconciled\n[matching accepted message]
Unknown --> Rejected : SM-T058 provider reconciled\n[definite rejection evidence]
legend bottom
A: accepted core behavior; P: existing proposal; R: proposed refinement.
State labels are analysis abstractions, not implemented enums.
Transition tables define full actor, guard, effect and status.
Unconfirmed operation effects require SM-M18 reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
